  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Administracin y Manejo Tierras</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Admin.  Management Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPECIFIC OBJECTIVES OF THE PROGRAM ARE: (I) FORMALIZE URBAN AND RURAL PARCELS BY REGISTRATION OF PROPERTY RIGHTS AND MODERNIZE THE TITLE REGISTRATION AND CADASTRAL SYSTEMS; (II) ASSIST IN THE DESIGN AND IMPLEMENTATION OF AN EFFICIENT SYSTEM FOR MANAGING PUBLIC LANDS; (III) ENABLE EFFECTIVE AND EFFICIENT MANAGEMENT OF LAND INFORMATION; AND (IV) FORMULATE A LAND USE AND DEVELOPMENT FRAMEWORK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
